@startuml SEQ_05_GANTI_PASSWORD
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-05: Ganti Password

actor       "Pengguna"           as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"            as Browser
control     "PasswordController" as Controller
entity      "User Model"         as Model
database    "users"              as DB

== Ganti Password ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Buka halaman Profile, isi form ganti password
Browser  -> Controller : PUT /password {current_password, password, password_confirmation}
Controller -> Model    : update({password})
Model -> DB            : UPDATE users SET password = ? WHERE id = ?
DB --> Model           : Berhasil
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Pengguna   : Tampil notifikasi password berhasil diperbarui

@enduml
